    "Consider adding one extra shoulder set next period, prioritizing a compound or overhead pressing movement to build shoulder mass alongside the rest of your upper body.",
    "Maintain your current leg training intensity and structure — legs showed the strongest strength index gain this period (+7 points), so the approach is clearly working and should be preserved."
  ],
  "contextSummary": "Outstanding period with strength index gains across all six muscle groups; overload is on track, mild biceps and shoulder volume gaps noted, and no deload needed — continue building on this momentum."
}
